id: rally-mark
name: Rallied
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: Captain (3)'s and Tactician (3)'s - a quarter of the giver's Modifier, rounded up, as stacks.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Captain, Tactician: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack, till the start of the giver's next turn.
text: >
  Captain (3), Tactician (3): Increase their Combat Rolls by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Personality (Scholarship) Modifier until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
